    {
      "id": "r20261031-a01",
      "title": "The First Snow",
      "level": "Dasar",
      "min": 2,
      "body": [
        "Yuki lives in a small town in Japan. Last night, the first snow of the year fell while everyone was sleeping.",
        "In the morning, Yuki opened her window and shouted with joy. The whole town was white! She quickly put on her warm jacket, boots, and red scarf, then ran outside.",
        "Yuki and her friends built a big snowman in the park. They used two stones for its eyes and a carrot for its nose. Before going home, they promised to meet again after school for a snowball fight."
      ],
      "gloss": {
        "fell": "turun",
        "shouted": "berteriak",
        "joy": "kegembiraan",
        "scarf": "syal",
        "stones": "batu",
